---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "The Visible Ads Blueprint | Our Methodology",
  "description": "Our proven 4-phase growth methodology: Discover, Strategise, Execute, Optimise.",
  "url": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/blueprint",
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Visible Ads"
  }
};
---

<Layout title="The Visible Ads Blueprint | Our Methodology" description="Our proven 4-phase growth methodology: Discover, Strategise, Execute, Optimise. Continuous improvement for sustainable advertising growth." schema={schema}>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-navy-light relative overflow-hidden" data-animate>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-pattern opacity-5"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">The Visible Ads Blueprint</h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-light leading-relaxed">Every successful advertising campaign starts with a system. Our Blueprint is the proven methodology we apply to every engagement, ensuring nothing is left to chance and every pound of your budget works harder than the last.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <div class="hidden lg:block relative mb-16">
        <div class="absolute top-8 left-[12.5%] right-[12.5%] h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-electric via-cyan-400 to-electric rounded-full"></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-8 relative">
          {[1,2,3,4].map(n => (
            <div class="flex justify-center">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-electric text-white font-heading font-bold text-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-electric/30 ring-4 ring-white">{n}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-20 lg:space-y-0 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-8">

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="lg:hidden flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-electric text-white font-heading font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-electric/30 flex-shrink-0">1</div>
            <div class="h-0.5 flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-electric to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-electric/10 hover:ring-electric/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all h-full">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-sky-tint flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-electric" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Discover</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">Before we touch a single campaign setting, we need to understand the full picture. Our discovery phase is an exhaustive deep-dive into your current advertising performance, identifying what is working, what is bleeding budget, and where the untapped opportunities sit.</p>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">We analyse your competitive landscape to understand how rivals are bidding, what messaging they lead with, and where gaps exist in the market that your brand can own. This is not a surface-level glance. We pull data from every available source and cross-reference it against industry benchmarks.</p>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-6">The output is a clear, honest assessment of where you stand and exactly how much room there is to grow.</p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-electric mb-3">Key Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Full account audit report</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Competitor analysis</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Market opportunity sizing</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Wasted spend identification</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="lg:hidden flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-electric text-white font-heading font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-electric/30 flex-shrink-0">2</div>
            <div class="h-0.5 flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-electric to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-electric/10 hover:ring-electric/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all h-full">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-sky-tint flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-electric" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Strategise</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">With a complete picture of the landscape, we build a data-driven strategy that connects your advertising directly to your business objectives. This is not a generic playbook. Every recommendation is tailored to your market, your margins, and your growth targets.</p>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">We determine the right channel mix, whether that is Google Search, Shopping, Display, Bing, Amazon, or a combination. Budget allocation is modelled against projected returns so you know exactly what to expect before a single penny is spent.</p>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-6">The strategy document becomes your north star for the engagement, something we revisit and refine as performance data comes in.</p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-electric mb-3">Key Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Channel strategy document</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Budget allocation model</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>KPI targets and forecasts</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Keyword and audience research</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="lg:hidden flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-electric text-white font-heading font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-electric/30 flex-shrink-0">3</div>
            <div class="h-0.5 flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-electric to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-electric/10 hover:ring-electric/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all h-full">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-sky-tint flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-electric" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Execute</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">This is where the strategy comes to life. Our team builds out every campaign element with precision: account structure, ad groups, keyword lists, negative keywords, bidding strategies, ad copy, extensions, and audiences. Nothing is rushed and nothing is templated.</p>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">We develop compelling creative assets and work with you on landing page optimisation to ensure the full journey from ad click to conversion is seamless. If your landing pages are letting you down, we will tell you exactly what to fix and why.</p>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-6">Launch is carefully staged. We monitor performance in real-time during the critical first days, making rapid adjustments to ensure the campaign hits the ground running.</p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-electric mb-3">Key Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Campaign build and launch</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Ad copy and creative assets</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Landing page recommendations</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Tracking and conversion setup</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="lg:hidden flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-electric text-white font-heading font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-electric/30 flex-shrink-0">4</div>
            <div class="h-0.5 flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-electric to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-electric/10 hover:ring-electric/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all h-full">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-sky-tint flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-electric" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Optimise</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">Launching a campaign is just the beginning. The real value is in what happens next. Our optimisation phase is a continuous cycle of testing, learning, and improving. We analyse performance data daily, adjusting bids, refining audiences, testing new ad variations, and eliminating waste.</p>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">We run structured A/B tests on ad copy, landing pages, and bidding strategies. Winners are scaled. Underperformers are paused or reworked. Every decision is backed by data, not gut feeling.</p>
            <p class="text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-6">Monthly reporting gives you full visibility into performance, spend, and the actions we have taken. You always know where your money is going and what it is generating.</p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-electric mb-3">Key Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Monthly performance reports</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>A/B test results and insights</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Bid and budget optimisation</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-dark"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Scaling recommendations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-sky-tint" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">Why a Blueprint?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-6">Most agencies treat advertising as a set-and-forget exercise. Build the campaigns, let them run, send a report at the end of the month. That approach leaves performance on the table and wastes your budget on outdated assumptions.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-dark leading-relaxed mb-6">The Visible Ads Blueprint is built on a philosophy of continuous improvement. Markets shift. Competitors adapt. Consumer behaviour evolves. Your advertising must evolve with it, and that requires a systematic, disciplined approach to optimisation that never stops learning.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-dark leading-relaxed">We have refined this methodology over 20 years and hundreds of client engagements. It works because it is repeatable, measurable, and adaptable to any industry, any platform, and any budget.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-gray-50" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">See the Blueprint Applied</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-dark mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Discover how we use this methodology across every channel we manage.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/google-ads" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-white text-navy font-semibold rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-electric hover:text-electric transition-all">See how we apply the Blueprint to Google Ads</a>
        <a href="/case-studies" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-white text-navy font-semibold rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-electric hover:text-electric transition-all">View our Case Studies</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-navy" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-4">See the Blueprint in Action</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-light mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Request your free ads audit and see how our methodology can transform your advertising performance.</p>
      <a href="/free-ads-audit" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-electric text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-electric-dark transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-electric/25 text-lg">
        Request Your Free Audit
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
